      "date": "2026-06-02T12:44:16.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.31 (vs ₹2.81 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.31 (down from ₹2.81 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹4.68b (up 14% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹42.4m (down 51% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 0.9% (down from 2.1% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 4% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 36% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
